      "id": "msg_1772493377530_9fpjl",
      "role": "model",
      "text": "- Analyzing the Malformed JSON\n- I'm currently focused on the \"Autonomia: Samorozwój (loopbreaker)\" task (ID: task1772492930955). It's a loop caused by incorrect JSON in blog articles. Specifically, HTML attributes are missing quotes, such as tag=k. I'm working to parse the malformed data to break the loop, but it's proving tricky.\n- Refining the Python Script\n- I'm now deep in the Python script's logic. My goal is to fix the JSON structure within the article files. I'm focusing on parsing the data/articles/.json files. My primary task is to correct attributes like tag=kimsondreams-21 target= and ensure proper quoting. I'm also planning to patch the Amazon link checker to handle 503 errors and will then resume the audit, as well as prevent future loops.\n- Addressing Malformed Amazon Links",
