      "role": "model",
      "text": "- Verifying Task Progress\n- I've verified the \"verifyfiles\" subtask as complete for \"Autonomia: Samorozwój (loopbreaker).\" Currently, I'm at 35% progress overall. I'm focusing on the continuation of task1772492930955.\n- Analyzing Loop Breakers\n- I'm currently focused on breaking the loop caused by malformed JSON and 503 errors. I've identified that fixjsonstructure is in progress, while preventfutureloops and resumeaudit are still pending. I'm prioritizing the success of SHELL as a potential workaround, given that PYTHONEXEC and FILEWRITE have had limited success recently. I'm reviewing the RECENTTOOLCACHE for more clues.\n- Addressing 503 Errors\n- I'm now focused on handling 503 errors and fixing malformed JSON. The previous sed attempt to patch the Amazon link checker failed. My plan is to patch scripts/amazonlinkchecker.cjs with a robust SHELL command to handle 503s. Also, I'll attempt a SHELL-executed Python script to fix the JSON files. I'll then verify those fixes.\n- Refining Script Execution",
