    {
      "id": "msg_1772493842753_gza8w",
      "role": "model",
      "text": "WEB_SEARCH RESULTS (cache):\n[\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Update .ftp-deploy-sync-state.json during sync process #341\",\n    \"link\": \"https://github.com/SamKirkland/FTP-Deploy-Action/issues/341\",\n    \"snippet\": \"Bug Description Please implement and option to auto update uploaded items to .ftp-deploy-sync-state.json and add parameter to change how often to update the json, so when the process due to random ...\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Creating an Orchestration to Retrieve, Update, and Send a File to an ...\",\n    \"link\": \"https://docs.oracle.com/en/applications/jd-edwards/tutorial-retrieve-update-ftp-orch/\",\n    \"snippet\": \"This tutorial shows you how to create an orchestration that uses SSH file transfer protocol (SFTP) to retrieve a file and send a file, in this example a JSON text file, to an FTP server.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Getting Files from an FTP Server using Node.js - w3tutorials.net\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.w3tutorials.net/blog/get-file-from-ftp-server-nodejs/\",\n    \"snippet\": \"This blog post will guide you through the process of getting files from an FTP server using Node.js, covering core concepts, typical usage scenarios, and best practices.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Updating WordPress using FTP - Advanced Administration Handbook ...\",\n    \"link\": \"https://developer.wordpress.org/advanced-administration/upgrade/ftp/\",\n    \"snippet\": \"When an FTP/SFTP client is a good choice: Larger or repeatable tasks (uploading many files/folders, replacing WordPress core during a manual update, uploading a theme/plugin, keeping a queue running, resuming interrupted transfers, or working faster with drag-and-drop and bulk operations). Is cPanel \\\"better\\\" than an FTP client?\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \".ftp-deploy-sync-state.json doesn't update #165 - GitHub\",\n    \"link\": \"https://github.com/SamKirkland/FTP-Deploy-Action/issues/165\",\n    \"snippet\": \"Bug Description On deploy, after deleting any file and folder .ftp-deploy-sync-state.json stops updating. And ftp deploy always do old actions on new deploy. Deleting .ftp-deploy-sync-state.json resolve the problem till next delete folde...\"\n  }\n]",
