      "role": "model",
      "text": "Executing [PYTHON_EXEC] \"import json; import os; data = { 'id': 'apple-watch-ultra-2-review', 'title': 'Apple Watch Ultra 2 Review: The Ultimate Rugged Smartwatch', 'subtitle': 'Comprehensive review of Apple\\\\'s most advanced outdoor smartwatch for adventurers and athletes', 'author': 'Technova Team', 'date': '2025-01-15', 'category': 'REVIEWS', 'tags': ['Tech', 'Apple', 'Wearables', 'Smartwatch', 'Fitness', 'Accessories'], 'image': 'images/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-main.jpg', 'content': '<p>The Apple Watch Ultra 2 represents the pinnacle of wearable technology for adventurers and athletes. Building upon the original Ultra success, this second-generation model brings refinements in performance, display brightness, and sustainability.</p><h2>Design and Build Quality</h2><p>The Ultra 2 maintains the distinctive 49mm titanium case. The aerospace-grade titanium is both lightweight and incredibly durable, capable of withstanding extreme conditions from deep-sea diving to mountain climbing.</p><h2>Display: Brighter Than Ever</h2><p>The Always-On Retina display now reaches 3000 nits of peak brightness, making it easily readable even in direct sunlight. The sapphire crystal front provides exceptional scratch resistance.</p><h2>Performance and Battery Life</h2><p>Powered by the S9 SiP chip, the Ultra 2 delivers smooth performance for all tasks. Battery life extends up to 36 hours in normal use and up to 72 hours in Low Power Mode.</p><h2>Where to Buy</h2><div class=\\\\'product-recommendation\\\\'><h3>Check Price on Amazon</h3><p><a href=\\\\'https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CHX3TW6T?tag=kimsondreams-21\\\\' target=\\\\'_blank\\\\' rel=\\\\'noopener\\\\'>Buy Apple Watch Ultra 2 on Amazon</a></p></div>' }; path = 'data/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json'; os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(path), exist_ok=True); with open(path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f: json.dump(data, f, indent=2); print(f'Successfully repaired {path}')\"",
