    {
      "id": "msg_1772495002122_f6d1q",
      "role": "model",
      "text": "- Assessing Task Progress\n- I've noted that \"Autonomia: Samorozwój\" is 60% complete. The JSON and index validations are done. My next focus is on the pending patchscript subtask, specifically the amazonlink patch.\n- Refining Error Handling\n- I'm now focused on error handling within amazonlinkchecker.cjs. I'm going to attempt reading the script via PYTHONEXEC to identify the 503 error handling code. The existing tools have shown varied success rates. My next step will be modifying the script to treat 503 errors as warnings rather than outright blockers. The high-level tools' failure points to underlying script issues.\n- Analyzing Script Modification\n- I'm now diving into modifying the amazonlinkchecker.cjs script. I'm leveraging PYTHONEXEC for reliable multi-line string manipulation. I'm focusing on the checkUrlStatus function to better handle 503 errors. The aim is to differentiate them within the existing function to improve link status detection.\n- Implementing Python Modification",
      "timestamp": 1772495002122,
