      "role": "model",
      "text": "- Assessing Task Progress\n- I see that task \"Autonomia: Samorozwój (loopbreaker)\" is at 60%. Notably, both fixjson and validateindex subtasks are complete. The remaining patchscript subtask, specifically patching amazonlinkchecker.cjs for 503 errors, is still pending. I need to focus on this last step.\n- Refining Strategy Implementation\n- I've shifted focus to a new hypothesis: the malformed JSON is blocking high-level tools. My plan is now to use PYTHONEXEC to write a perfect JSON file, correcting apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json. Simultaneously, I'll use PYTHONEXEC to patch amazonlinkchecker.cjs to treat 503 errors as warnings. I am confident that these actions will advance the pending patchscript subtask, and address the high-level tool failures.\n- Confirming Stability & Actions\n- I'm now prioritizing the execution plan. First, using PYTHONEXEC, I'll rigorously validate and correct apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json ensuring valid JSON and HTML within the content field, fixing the issues with the HTML tags that I identified. Next, I plan to modify scripts/amazonlinkchecker.cjs to handle 503 errors and log them as warnings within the checkUrlStatus function. Finally, if unblocked, I'll use FILEWRITE or SHELL to verify stability.",
