      "text": "- Verifying JSON Structure\n- I have just completed fixing the malformed JSON file, apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json. I confirmed its validity by using cat from RECENTTOOLCACHE on the file, verifying it is now structured correctly. This ensures the data is properly formatted for further processing.\n- Confirming Script Modifications\n- I'm now focused on patching scripts/amazonlinkchecker.cjs to robustly handle 503 errors within the checkUrlStatus function. I intend to modify the function to specifically identify 503 responses and log them as warnings. Subsequently, I'll run a quick command via FILEWRITE or SHELL to ensure the system remains stable and that high-level tools are unblocked for me. Once this is done, I will update the associated task's status.\n- Refining Error Handling\n- I've just refined the checkUrlStatus function to explicitly identify and handle 503 errors. The modification now includes is503 in the resolved object, clarifying whether the response code indicates a 503. I also changed how the loop works to take the is503 value into account.",
