      "id": "msg_1772495558667_bzjde",
      "role": "model",
      "text": "- Analyzing Blocked Tools\n- I'm currently focused on the \"loop breaker\" state of task task1772493894762. My primary observation is that high-level tools, specifically FILEWRITE, WEBREAD, and FILEREPLACE, are failing, with a 0% success rate. The task itself is labeled \"Autonomia: Samorozwój (loopbreaker)\". This prompts me to identify why these critical tools are rendered ineffective within this particular context.\n- Refining Error Resolution\n- I've determined that SHELL and PYTHONEXEC remain operational, confirming the core execution environment. My hypothesis centers on malformed JSON within data/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json and inadequate 503 handling in scripts/amazonlinkchecker.cjs, which is actively preventing tool utilization. Although fixes have been attempted, the stabilitytest.txt file is absent, and the primary task persists as inprogress. I observed HTML issues in the JSON content, specifically in apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json, and am pursuing a multi-step plan to remedy these issues.",
