 and `PYTHONEXEC` are currently failing.\",\n        \"[STAGE/autonomy] Ollama: oczekiwanie na odpowiedź\",\n        \"[STAGE/autonomy] Ollama: odpowiedź odebrana (4s)\",\n        \"[STAGE/autonomy] Analiza odpowiedzi\",\n        \"[STAGE/autonomy] Analiza odpowiedzi...\",\n        \"[STAGE/autonomy] Wykonywanie: [WEB_SEARCH] how to handle amazon 503 service unavailable in no...\",\n        \"[STAGE/autonomy] Wykonywanie: [SHELL] \\\"cat scripts/amazon_link_checker.cjs\\\"\",\n        \"[STAGE/autonomy] Wykonywanie: [SHELL] \\\"ls -la data/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-review.j...\",\n        \"[STAGE/autonomy] Start cyklu autonomii\",\n        \"[STAGE/autonomy] Wykonywanie zadania: Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\",\n        \"[STAGE/autonomy] Model: deepseek-v3.2:cloud (Role: architecture)\",\n        \"[STAGE/support] Support hint requested for active task: Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\",\n        \"[STAGE/support] Support idea: SUPPORT_HINT: Use `sed` or `cat <<EOF` via `SHELL` to manually patch `scripts/amazon_link_checker.cjs` and fix malformed JSON articles, as `FILE_WRITE` is currently unreliable.\",\n        \"[STAGE/autonomy] Ollama: oczekiwanie na odpowiedź\",\n        \"[STAGE/autonomy] Ollama: odpowiedź odebrana (7s)\",\n        \"[STAGE/autonomy] Analiza odpowiedzi\",\n--\n        \"[STAGE/autonomy] Wykonywanie: [TASK_ACTION] {\\\"action\\\": \\\"update\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"task_1772493894762\\\", \\\"...\",\n        \"Fixed malformed JSON in apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json using SHELL cat. Updated subtasks to focus on recovery.\",\n        \"[STAGE/autonomy] Wykonywanie: [SHELL] \\\"node -p \\\\\\\"require('./data/articles/apple-watch-ul...\",\n        \"[STAGE/autonomy] Start cyklu autonomii\",\n        \"[STAGE/autonomy] Wykonywanie zadania: Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\",\n        \"[STAGE/autonomy] Model: deepseek-v3.2:cloud (Role: architecture)\",\n        \"[STAGE/support] Support hint requested for active task: Autonomia: S