      "text": "- Analyzing System Behaviors\n- I've observed a critical shift. High-level tools like FILEWRITE and WEBREAD are failing consistently. However, lower-level tools, SHELL and PYTHONEXEC, continue to function normally. My current hypothesis is that a loop or repetitive actions are causing the kernel to block these high-level actions. I need to investigate what's triggering this behavior.\n- Investigating Data Structures",
