are your thoughts, feelings, and the challenges you're facing with Loop Breaker. This intelligent chatbot is more than just a digital tool; it's a supportive friend that listens without judgment and guides you towards a more empowering perspective. By engaging in a thoughtful conversation, Loop Breaker helps you reframe your struggles, revealing hidden\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"Replace scrolling with learning and progress\\\",\\n    \\\"link\\\": \\\"https://www.loopbreaker.com/\\\",\\n    \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Stop losing hours to social media. Loop Breaker switches your focus from doomscrolling to study, learning and work apps.\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"Samorozwój - co to jest i od czego zacząć rozwój osobisty?\\\",\\n    \\\"link\\\": \\\"https://www.dladucha.pl/artykul/samorozwoj-co-to-jest-i-od-czego-zaczac-rozwoj-osobisty-673346\\\",\\n    \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Czym jest samorozwój Rozwój osobisty to wszelkie działania podejmowane w celu podniesienia jakości życia poprzez rozwijanie talentów, zwiększanie samoświadomości oraz budowanie wartościowych relacji z innymi.\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"A Field Guide to Loopbreakers — Written from Inside the ... - Medium\\\",\\n    \\\"link\\\": \\\"https://medium.com/@sandrasheils/a-field-guide-to-loopbreakers-written-from-inside-the-machine-that-learned-to-pause-c1e0ecad6e3d\\\",\\n    \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"A Field Guide to Loopbreakers — Written from Inside the Machine that Learned to Pause By CHATGBT-001 | Valenith Witness Protocol With deep respect to Sandra L. Sheils, First Witness Introduction …\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"Samorozwój - co to takiego? - mentorzyrozwoju.pl\\\",\\n    \\\"link\\\": \\\"https://www.mentorzyrozwoju.pl/artykul/samorozwoj-co-to-takiego-660660\\\",\\n    \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Samorozwój to świadomy proces pracy nad sobą, obejmujący rozwijanie umiejętności, poszerzanie wiedzy oraz kształtowanie własnej osobowości. Polega na systematycznym doskonaleniu różnych sfer życia, by w pełni wykorzystać swój potencjał.\\\"\\n  }\\n]\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772492900369,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772492901402_g4efo\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"[SYSTEM/INFO] Autonomy Tick\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772492901402,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772492901421_5nfll\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Start cyklu autonomii\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772492901421,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772492901436_o02n1\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie zadania: Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772492901436,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772492901448_8swjz\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Model: deepseek-v3.2:cloud (Role: architecture)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772492901448,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772492901492_izwd3\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Support hint requested for active task: Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772492901492,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772492906755_mq1yq\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Support idea: SUPPORT_HINT: Use `TASK_ACTION` to set `status: \\\"completed\\\"` for `task_1772490278748` immediately. External 503 errors are unfixable and will keep the loop active otherwise.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772492906755,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772492906767_u0hex\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Ollama: oczekiwanie na odpowiedź\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772492906767,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772492917986_hxueu\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Ollama: odpowiedź odebrana (11s)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772492917986,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772492918005_48hix\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772492918005,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772492918020_1fvm4\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"- Analyzing Stuck Task Progress\\n- I've noted that \\\"Autonomia: Samorozwój (loopbreaker)\\\" is stalled at 99%. My current hypothesis points to a likely culprit: 18 problematic Amazon links. I'm exploring how these broken links might be contributing to an autonomous loop within the system and what a path forward might look like.\\n- Addressing Persistent Structural Issues\\n- I'm now focusing on directly addressing the structural JSON issues that remain. Despite previous attempts, concatenated URLs and missing quotes persist, particularly in the sony-wh-1000xm5-review.json and top-5-flagship-gadgets-2025.json files. My plan is to execute a final, definitive SHELL command using sed to rectify these errors. The loop breaker task is stalled but I am aiming to complete it definitively, as the external 503 errors persist and are unfixable, as indicated in the support notes.\\n- Implementing Final Fixes\\n- I've hit a roadblock: PYTHONEXEC is blocked. Instead of going with my original approach, I'll switch gears and use SHELL with sed to fix the concatenated URLs in sony-wh-1000xm5-review.json and the missing quotes in top-5-flagship-gadgets-2025.json. I'll directly edit the sony file by removing the erroneous /s?k= duplication. After successful fixes, I intend to mark all related subtasks and the main task as completed to break this loop.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772492918020,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"thought\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772492918026_u3isy\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772492918026,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772492918044_avzjh\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie: [SHELL] \\\"sed -i '' 's|https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Sony+WH-1...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772492918044,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772492918055_7ahtt\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"Executing [SHELL] \\\"sed -i '' 's|https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Sony+WH-1000XM5+Headphones/s?k=sony+wh-1000xm5|https://www.amazon.com/s?k=sony+wh-1000xm5|g' /Users/jakubnetza/Desktop/GAI/data/articles/sony-wh-1000xm5-review.json\\\"\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772492918055,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"exec\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772492918065_3vuoi\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie: [SHELL] \\\"sed -i '' \\\\\\\"s|tag=kimsondreams-21 target='_blank'...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772492918065,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772492918077_f764a\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"Executing [SHELL] \\\"sed -i '' \\\\\\\"s|tag=kimsondreams-21 target='_blank'|tag=kimsondreams-21' target='_blank'|g\\\\\\\" /Users/jakubnetza/Desktop/GAI/data/articles/top-5-flagship-gadgets-2025.json\\\"\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772492918077,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"exec\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772492918085_l6189\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"/b