prevent future occurrences.\\n- Formulating a Repair Script\\n- I'm now focused on devising a Python script to address the JSON corruption. I plan to read the link checker to learn the expected format of HTML attributes and the current handling of 503 errors. The masterrepair.py script will correct the quotation marks, concatenated URLs, and future dates in the articles and also patch the link checker. This consolidated approach should break the loop. The script will be created via FILEWRITE and executed via SHELL.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493311157,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"thought\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493311163_fqnhl\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493311163,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493311178_hutgq\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"AUTONOMY BLOCKED: TOOL success rate 0%. Choose alternative.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493311178,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493311188_x4b5f\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"AUTONOMY BLOCKED: TOOL success rate 0%. Choose alternative.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493311188,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493311202_6rhx9\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"AUTONOMY BLOCKED: TOOL success rate 0%. Choose alternative.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493311202,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493311211_sk458\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"AUTONOMY BLOCKED: TOOL success rate 0%. Choose alternative.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493311211,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493311224_9q9n5\",\n      