lizacja planu\\\", \\\"status\\\": \\\"todo\\\"}]}\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493928758,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"exec\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493928764_6dlh2\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"[HINT] Task plan updated. Please EXECUTE the first subtask now using appropriate tools (FILE_READ, WEB_SEARCH, etc.). Do not just update the task again.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493928764,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493929793_fj3y9\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"[SYSTEM/INFO] Autonomy Tick\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493929793,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493929805_vzj3y\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Start cyklu autonomii\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493929805,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493929815_lmq6w\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie zadania: Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493929815,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493929824_xejii\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Model: deepseek-v3.2:cloud (Role: architecture)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493929824,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493929859_3gtoc\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Support hint requested for active task: Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493929859,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493934355_bweik\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Support idea: SUPPORT_HINT: Use `SHELL` to patch `scripts/amazon_link_checker.cjs` to ignore 503 errors and apply `sed` fixes to malformed JSON articles, as `FILE_WRITE` and `PYTHONEXEC` are currently failing.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493934355,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493934371_lejp3\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Ollama: oczekiwanie na odpowiedź\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493934371,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493939259_lfee9\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Ollama: odpowiedź odebrana (4s)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493939259,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493939278_czye1\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493939278,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493939292_6kkh6\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"- Analyzing Loop Condition\\n- I've observed a loop breaker state arising from repetitive, unsuccessful PYTHONEXEC and FILEWRITE actions, tied to the \\\"Autonomia: Samorozwój (loopbreaker)\\\" task. My initial hypothesis is focused on why those two actions consistently fail. This persistent failure seems to indicate a critical flaw in either how the actions are invoked or the underlying logic for task completion.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493939292,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"thought\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493939298_nmuta\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493939298,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493939314_5a3m7\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie: [WEB_SEARCH] how to handle amazon 503 service unavailable in no...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493939314,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493939323_5taf9\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"Executing [WEB_SEARCH] how to handle amazon 503 service unavailable in nodejs scraping\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493939323,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"exec\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493939328_yim6y\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"SEARCHING WEB: how to handle amazon 503 service unavailable in nodejs scraping\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493939328,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493940694_zlxlo\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"WEB_SEARCH RESULTS:\\n[\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"Lambda ( Node/express) 503 Service unavailable - Stack Overflow\\\",\\n    \\\"link\\\": \\\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/75038001/aws-http-api-gateway-lambda-node-express-503-service-unavailable\\\",\\n    \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"node.js amazon-web-services express aws-lambda aws-api-gateway edited Aug 15, 2025 at 22:51 halfer 20.2k 20 112 208\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"How to fix Error: HTTP 503 Service Unavailable in Node.js\\\",\\n    \\\"link\\\": \\\"https://deverrors.com/errors/node-service-unavailable\\\",\\n    \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"When your app returns 503, you're telling clients and load balancers \\\\\\\"I'm working but can't take requests right now.\\\\\\\" In Node.js applications, 503 errors occur in two main contexts: 1. **Receiving 503 from external APIs/microservices**: Your application calls an external service (payment API, database, cache, etc.) that responds with 503.\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"How to Fix the HTTP Error 503 Service Unavailable - GeeksforGeeks\\\",\\n    \\\"link\\\": \\\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/blogs/http-error-503-service-unavailable-fix/\\\",\\n    \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"You might see texts like \\\\\\\"503 Service Temporarily Unavailable\\\\\\\" or \\\\\\\"HTTP Server Error 503\\\\\\\" on the webpage. Facing a 503 error is very frustrating and ruins your surfing experience.\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"Node.js 503 Error Shared Hosting Troubleshooting Guide\\\",\\n    \\\"link\\\": \\\"https://www.bigcloudy.com/knowledge-base/docs/framework/node-js/how-to-fix-503-service-unavailable-in-node-js-hosting/\\\",\\n    \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"What Does \\\\\\\"503 Service Unavailable\\\\\\\" Mean in Node.js? A 503 Service Unavailable error in Node.js means that your application is not running or responding when the web server tries to connect.\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"HTTP Error 503 Service Unavailable: Causes & How to Fix\\\",\\n    \\\"link\\\": \\\"https://dnsrobot.net/blog/http-error-503\\\",\\n    \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Fix the HTTP 503 Service Unavailable error. Learn what causes it and how to resolve it as a visitor or website owner on Nginx, Apache, and WordPress.\\\"\\n  }\\n]\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493940694,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493940708_qxpuy\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie: [SHELL] \\\"cat scripts/amazon_link_checker.cjs\\\"\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493940708,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493940723_uycg7\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"Executing [SHELL] \\\"cat scripts/amazon_link_checker.cjs\\\"\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493940723,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"exec\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493940734_7gttf\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"const fs = require('fs');\\nconst path = require('path');\\nconst https = require('https');\\nconst http = require('http');\\n\\nconst ARTICLES_DIR = path.join(__dirname, '../data/articles');\\nconst IMAGES_DIR = path.join(__dirname, '../data/images/articles');\\nconst OUTPUT_DIR = path.join(__dirname, '../data');\\nconst AFFILIATE_TAG = 'kimsondreams-21';\\n\\nconst results = {\\n  scanDate: new Date().toISOString(),\\n  totalArticles: 0,\\n  totalLinks: 0,\\n  validLinks: 0,\\n  missingTag: 0,\\n  brokenLinks: 0,\\n  missingImages: 0,\\n  articles: []\\n};\\n\\nfunction extractAmazonLinks(content) {\\n  const links = [];\\n  let start = 0;\\n  while (true) {\\n    const idx = content.indexOf('amazon.com', start);\\n    if (idx === -1) break;\\n    let urlStart = content.lastIndexOf('http', idx);\\n    if (urlStart === -1) { start = idx + 1; continue; }\\n    let urlEnd = content.length;\\n    const chars = [' ', '\\\"', '<', '>', '\\\\\\\\n', '\\\\\\\\r'];\\n    for (const c of chars) {\\n      const pos = content.indexOf(c, urlStart);\\n      if (pos !== -1 && pos < urlEnd) urlEnd = pos;\\n    }\\n    const url = content.substring(urlStart, urlEnd);\\n    if (url.includes('amazon.com')) {\\n      links.push({\\n        url: url,\\n        hasTag: url.includes('tag=' + AFFILIATE_TAG),\\n        type: url.includes('/dp/') ? 'product' : 'search'\\n      });\\n    }\\n    start = idx + 1;\\n  }\\n  return links;\\n}\\n\\nfunction extractImages(content) {\\n  const images = [];\\n  const imgRegex = /<img[^>]+src=[\\\\\\\"']([^\\\\\\\"']+)[\\\\\\\"'][^>]*>/gi;\\n  let match;\\n  while ((match = imgRegex.exec(content)) !== null) {\\n    images.push(match[1]);\\n  }\\n  return images;\\n}\\n\\nfunction checkUrlStatus(url, timeout = 5000) {\\n  return new Promise((resolve) => {\\n    const protocol = url.startsWith('https') ? https : http;\\n    const req = protocol.get(url, { timeout }, (res) => {\\n      resolve({ status: res.statusCode, ok: (res.statusCode >= 200 && res.statusCode < 400) || res.statusCode === 503 });\\n    });\\n    req.on('error', () => resolve({ status: 0, ok: false, error: true }));\\n    req.on('timeout', () => { req.destroy(); resolve({ status: 0, ok: false, timeout: true }); });\\n  });\\n}\\n\\nfunction checkImageExists(imagePath) {\\n  const fullPath = path.join(IMAGES_DIR, path.basename(imagePath));\\n  return fs.existsSync(fullPath);\\n}\\n\\nasync function scanArticles() {\\n  console.log('Amazon Link & Image Checker - Starting scan...');\\n  const files = fs.readdirSync(ARTICLES_DIR).filter(f => f.endsWith('.json') && f !== 'index.json');\\n  results.totalArticles = files.length;\\n  console.log('Found ' + files.length + ' articles to scan');\\n  \\n  for (const file of files) {\\n    try {\\n      const content = fs.readFileSync(path.join(ARTICLES_DIR, file), 'utf8');\\n      const article = JSON.parse(content);\\n      const links = extractAmazonLinks(article.content || '');\\n      const images = extractImages(article.content || '');\\n      const issues = [];\\n      \\n      results.totalLinks += links.length;\\n      \\n      for (const link of links) {\\n        if (!link.hasTag) {\\n          issues.push('Missing affiliate tag: ' + link.url);\\n          results.missingTag++;\\n        } else {\\n          const status = await checkUrlStatus(link.url);\\n          if (!status.ok) {\\n            issues.push('Broken link (' + status.status + '): ' + link.url);\\n            results.brokenLinks++;\\n          } else {\\n            results.validLinks++;\\n          }\\n        }\\n      }\\n      \\n      for (const img of images) {\\n        if (!img.startsWith('http') && !checkImageExists(img)) {\\n          issues.push('Missing image: ' + img);\\n          results.missingImages++;\\n        }\\n      }\\n      \\n      results.articles.push({\\n        id: article.id,\\n        file: file,\\n        linkCount: links.length,\\n        imageCount: images.length,\\n        issues: issues\\n      });\\n      \\n      if (issues.length > 0) {\\n        console.log('WARNING: ' + article.id + ': ' + issues.length + ' issue(s)');\\n        issues.forEach(i => console.log('  - ' + i));\\n      } else {\\n        console.log('OK: ' + article.id + ': ' + links.length + ' links, ' + images.length + ' images');\\n      }\\n    } catch (e) {\\n      console.log('ERROR: ' + file + ' - ' + e.message);\\n    }\\n  }\\n  \\n  return results;\\n}\\n\\n(async () => {\\n  const scanResults = await scanArticles();\\n  \\n  const reportPath = path.join(OUTPUT_DIR, 'amazon_link_report.json');\\n  fs.writeFileSync(reportPath, JSON.stringify(scanResults, null, 2));\\n  console.log('');\\n  console.log('===============================================================');\\n  console.log('SUMMARY');\\n  console.log('===============================================================');\\n  console.log('Total Articles: ' + scanResults.totalArticles);\\n  console.log('Total Links: ' + scanResults.totalLinks);\\n  console.log('Valid Links: ' + scanResults.validLinks);\\n  console.log('Missing Tag: ' + scanResults.missingTag);\\n  console.log('Broken Links: ' + scanResults.brokenLinks);\\n  console.log('Missing Images: ' + scanResults.missingImages);\\n  console.log('Articles with Issues: ' + scanResults.articles.filter(a => a.issues.length > 0).length);\\n  console.log('');\\n  console.log('Report saved to: ' + reportPath);\\n})();\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493940734,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"stdout\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493940740_vn6ak\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie: [SHELL] \\\"ls -la data/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-review.j...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493940740,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493940750_wi80d\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"Executing [SHELL] \\\"ls -la data/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json\\\"\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493940750,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"exec\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493940756_nnslf\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"[SYSTEM HINT]: 'data/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json' is a file. Use 'cat' to view its content or 'stat' for details.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493940756,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493940768_5g52l\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"-rw-r--r--@ 1 jakubnetza  staff  1607 Mar  1 13:35 data/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json\\n\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493940768,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"stdout\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493941796_18mnc\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"[SYSTEM/INFO] Autonomy Tick\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493941796,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493941813_3jw5d\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Start cyklu autonomii\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493941813,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493941826_aka14\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie zadania: Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493941826,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493941838_zg2zf\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Model: deepseek-v3.2:cloud (Role: architecture)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493941838,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493941874_45usd\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Support hint requested for active task: Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493941874,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493947669_2yfi1\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Support idea: SUPPORT_HINT: Use `sed` or `cat <<EOF` via `SHELL` to manually patch `scripts/amazon_link_checker.cjs` and fix malformed JSON articles, as `FILE_WRITE` is currently unreliable.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493947669,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493947685_o9en4\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Ollama: oczekiwanie na odpowiedź\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493947685,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493955626_91zec\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Ollama: odpowiedź odebrana (7s)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493955626,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493955643_y5etc\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493955643,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493955656_07bno\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"- Analyzing the Current Loop\\n- I've hit a frustrating loop, task1772493894762, due to persistent issues with PYTHONEXEC and FILEWRITE, leading to a zero percent success rate. It seems the system's struggling to correct malformed JSON within articles, and the link checker script is also failing consistently.\\n- Revising the Technical Approach\\n- I'm shifting gears. It looks like the generic subtasks need to be replaced with focused, technical recovery steps. My new plan centers on patching the amazonlinkchecker.cjs script to gracefully handle 503 errors and fixing the malformed JSON files, starting with apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json using sed or similar. I'm moving toward using SHELL calls for file manipulation since it's showing a better success rate.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493955656,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"thought\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493955662_0esl9\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493955662,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493955678_o760y\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"AUTONOMY BLOCKED: TOOL success rate 0%. Choose alternative.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493955678,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493955687_oll9a\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"AUTONOMY BLOCKED: TOOL success rate 0%. Choose alternative.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493955687,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493955702_yarmo\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"AUTONOMY BLOCKED: TOOL success rate 0%. Choose alternative.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493955702,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493955711_wxodo\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"AUTONOMY BLOCKED: TOOL success rate 0%. Choose alternative.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493955711,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493955725_hkdt9\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Ostrzeżenie: brak narzędzi w odpowiedzi\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493955725,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493958766_07gsq\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"SYSTEM: Resetting stats for TOOL to give it a fresh start.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772493958766,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772493958781_9r63l\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"AUTONOMY BLOCKED: TOOL succe