d data and scripts via SHELL. I'm abandoning the generic \\\"Samorozwój\\\" subtasks for more targeted steps, and will verify the file integrity.\\n- Validating File Integrity\\n- I'm now zeroing in on data integrity, specifically validating the problematic files. I'm taking the steps: I'll use node -e to check the validity of index.json, apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json and syntax of amazonlinkchecker.cjs, based on the failure reported from FILEWRITE. I've already confirmed amazonlinkchecker.cjs's content via cat and apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json exists. I'll modify the subtasks.\\n- Addressing Tool Blockage\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494539824,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"thought\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494539829_5jhw5\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494539829,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494539844_8p0fv\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie: [SHELL] \\\"node -e \\\\\\\"try { require('./data/articles/index.js...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494539844,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494539853_oyfbl\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"Executing [SHELL] \\\"node -e \\\\\\\"try { require('./data/articles/index.json'); console.log('INDEX_OK'); } catch(e) { console.log('INDEX_ERROR: ' + e.message); }\\\\\\\" && node -e \\\\\\\"try { require('./data/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json'); console.log('ARTICLE_OK'); } catch(e) { console.log('ARTICLE_ERROR: ' + e.message); }\\\\\\\" && ls -lh data/articles/index.json\\\"\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494539853,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"exec\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494539860_ctjlf\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"/bin/bash: -c: line 0: syntax error ne