 },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494549778_tt3u1\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Ollama: oczekiwanie na odpowiedź\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494549778,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494560661_lnqx0\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Ollama: odpowiedź odebrana (10s)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494560661,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494560680_h0w1f\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494560680,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494560694_nrxql\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"- Analyzing Loop Conditions\\n- I'm currently stuck in a loop-breaking scenario, and high-level tools are proving ineffective. My focus is on understanding the root cause of this loop. The FILEWRITE, WEBREAD, and FILEREPLACE tools are all consistently failing, so I am analyzing the conditions that would prevent their success, to deduce the system's current state. I need to break this failure cycle.\\n- Diagnosing Shell Issues\\n- I've determined that SHELL is the most stable tool, and I'm using it to address the core problem. I hypothesize data corruption in data/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json and potentially data/articles/index.json. The scripts/amazonlinkchecker.cjs script is valid. I've examined both JSON files, with the FILEWRITE failing on the former, and I'm currently dealing with SHELL command syntax errors.\\n- Revising Subtasks Urgently\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494560694,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"thought\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494560700_l4h5v\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494560700,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494560716_r0m5h\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie: [SHELL] \\\"cat data/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494560716,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494560725_ltvp3\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"Executing [SHELL] \\\"cat data/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json\\\"\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494560725,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"exec\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494560734_4r1wj\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"apple-watch-ultra-2-review\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Apple Watch Ultra 2 Review: The Ultimate Rugged Smartwatch\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Comprehensive review of Apple's most advanced outdoor smartwatch for adventurers and athletes\\\",\\\"author\\\":\\\"Technova Team\\\",\\\"date\\\":\\\"2025-01-15\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"REVIEWS\\\",\\\"tags\\\":[\\\"Tech\\\",\\\"Apple\\\",\\\"Wearables\\\",\\\"Smartwatch\\\",\\\"Fitness\\\",\\\"Accessories\\\"],\\\"image\\\":\\\"images/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-main.jpg\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"<p>The Apple Watch Ultra 2 represents the pinnacle of wearable technology for adventurers and athletes. Building upon the original Ultra success, this second-generation model brings refinements in performance, display brightness, and sustainability.</p><h2>Design and Build Quality</h2><p The Ultra 2 maintains the distinctive 49mm titanium case. The aerospace-grade titanium is both lightweight and incredibly durable, capable of withstanding extreme conditions from deep-sea diving to mountain climbing.</p><h2>Display: Brighter Than Ever</h2><p>The Always-On Retina display now reaches 3000 nits of peak brightness, making it easily readable even in direct sunlight. The sapphire crystal front provides exceptional scratch resistance.</p><h2>Performance and Battery Life</h2><p Powered by the S9 SiP chip, the Ultra 2 delivers smooth performance for all tasks. Battery life extends up to 36 hours in normal use and up to 72 hours in Low Power Mode.</p><h2>Where to Buy</h2><div class='product-recommendation'><h3>Check Price on Amazon</h3><p <a href='https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CHX3TW6T?tag=kimsondreams-21 target='_blank' rel='noopener'>Buy Apple Watch Ultra 2 on Amazon</a></p></div>\\\"}\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494560734,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"stdout\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494560739_w1uxw\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie: [SHELL] \\\"python3 -m json.tool data/articles/index.json > /...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494560739,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494560748_0uvpw\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"Executing [SHELL] \\\"python3 -m json.tool data/articles/index.json > /dev/null && echo 'INDEX_VALID' || echo 'INDEX_INVALID'\\\"\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494560748,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"exec\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494560753_hczya\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"SECURITY ALERT: Absolute path outside app root blocked.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494560753,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"stderr\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494560758_6o7qz\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie: [SHELL] \\\"python3 -m json.tool data/articles/apple-watch-ul...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494560758,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494560767_gjwso\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"Executing [SHELL] \\\"python3 -m json.tool data/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json > /dev/null && echo 'ARTICLE_VALID' || echo