ect the corrupted files.\\n- Formulating Remediation Strategy\\n- I've formulated a hypothesis: system blockages are from internal monitors reacting to repeated failures on malformed data. My plan involves correcting apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json with SHELL using cat << 'EOF', providing validated JSON. Then I'll validate it. I'll also check index.json for truncation. If successful, the \\\"loop breaker\\\" should clear, and I'll attempt TASKACTION again.\\n- Examining Corrupted Content\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494583705,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"thought\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494583711_hntq9\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494583711,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494583728_zri8n\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie: [SHELL] \\\"cat << 'EOF' > data/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494583728,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494583738_b8ir9\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"Executing [SHELL] \\\"cat << 'EOF' > data/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json\\n{\\n  \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"apple-watch-ultra-2-review\\\\\\\",\\n  \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Apple Watch Ultra 2 Review: The Ultimate Rugged Smartwatch\\\\\\\",\\n  \\\\\\\"subtitle\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Comprehensive review of Apple's most advanced outdoor smartwatch for adventurers and athletes\\\\\\\",\\n  \\\\\\\"author\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Technova Team\\\\\\\",\\n  \\\\\\\"date\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"2025-01-15\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"category\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"REVIEWS\\\\\\\",\\n  \\\\\\\"tags\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Tech\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Apple\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wearables\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Smartwatch\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Fitness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Accessories\\\\\\\"],\\n  \\\\\\\"ima