that JSON.\\n- Refining File Fixes\\n- I am now focusing on the JSON and HTML repairs. My approach for apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json involves direct shell manipulation, bypassing the blocked high-level tools. I've read and identified the malformed HTML/JSON. I am now validating using a simpler node command to work around shell escaping issues. Next, I plan on enhancing the Amazon link checker script.\\n- Validating JSON Integrity\\n- I'm now zeroing in on validating index.json comprehensively. My current assessment includes ensuring the file isn't just valid at the tail end, but is structurally sound throughout. I'm also preparing to update the subtasks to accurately reflect the necessary technical steps for file repair. It appears the Amazon link checker script needs immediate attention, to make it more robust in the face of malformed input. This involves ensuring the script, and the file, are able to handle the current known errors, as well as unknown future errors. I have the JSON file content ready for apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json.\\n- Confirming HTML Repairs\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494606206,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"thought\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494606212_9j4p9\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494606212,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494606226_4s56z\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie: [SHELL] \\\"cat << 'EOF' > data/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494606226,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494606235_cxy1j\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"Executing [SHELL] \\\"cat << 'EOF' > data/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json\\n{\\n  \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"apple-watch-ultra-2-review\\\\\\\",\\n  \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Apple Watch Ultra 2 Review: The Ultimate Rugged Smartwatch\\\\\\\",\\n  \\\\\\\"subtitle\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Comprehensive review of Apple's most advanced outdoor smartwatch for adventurers and athletes\\\\\\\",\\n  \\\\\\\"author\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Technova Team\\\\\\\",\\n  \\\\\\\"date\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"2025-01-15\\\\\\\",\\n  \\\\\\\"category\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"REVIEWS\\\\\\\",\\n  \\\\\\\"tags\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Tech\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Apple\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wearables\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Smartwatch\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Fitness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Accessories\\\\\\\"],\\n  \\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"images/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-main.jpg\\\\\\\",\\n  \\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"<p>The Apple Watch Ultra 2 represents the pinnacle of wearable technology for adventurers and athletes. Building upon the original Ultra success, this second-generation model brings refinements in performance, display brightness, and sustainability.</p><h2>Design and Build Quality</h2><p>The Ultra 2 maintains the distinctive 49mm titanium case. The aerospace-grade titanium is both lightweight and incredibly durable, capable of withstanding extreme conditions from deep-sea diving to mountain climbing.</p><h2>Display: Brighter Than Ever</h2><p>The Always-On Retina display now reaches 3000 nits of peak brightness, making it easily readable even in direct sunlight. The sapphire crystal front provides exceptional scratch resistance.</p><h2>Performance and Battery Life</h2><p>Powered by the S9 SiP chip, the Ultra 2 delivers smooth performance for all tasks. Battery life extends up to 36 hours in normal use and up to 72 hours in Low Power Mode.</p><h2>Where to Buy</h2><div class='product-recommendation'><h3>Check Price on Amazon</h3><p><a href='https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CHX3TW6T?tag=kimsondreams-21' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>Buy Apple Watch Ultra 2 on Amazon</a></p></div>\\\\\\\"\\n}\\nEOF\\n\\\"\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494606235,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"log