ditions from deep-sea diving to mountain climbing.</p><h2>Display: Brighter Than Ever</h2><p>The Always-On Retina display now reaches 3000 nits of peak brightness, making it easily readable even in direct sunlight. The sapphire crystal front provides exceptional scratch resistance.</p><h2>Performance and Battery Life</h2><p>Powered by the S9 SiP chip, the Ultra 2 delivers smooth performance for all tasks. Battery life extends up to 36 hours in normal use and up to 72 hours in Low Power Mode.</p><h2>Where to Buy</h2><div class='product-recommendation'><h3>Check Price on Amazon</h3><p><a href='https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CHX3TW6T?tag=kimsondreams-21' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>Buy Apple Watch Ultra 2 on Amazon</a></p></div>\\\\\\\"\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nwith open(path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\\\\n    json.dump(content, f, indent=2)\\\\n\\\\nindex_path = 'data/articles/index.json'\\\\nwith open(index_path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\\\\n    index_data = json.load(f)\\\\n\\\\nprint(f\\\\\\\"SUCCESS: Fixed {path}\\\\\\\")\\\\nprint(f\\\\\\\"SUCCESS: Validated {index_path} (contains {len(index_data)} entries)\\\\\\\")\\\"\\n  }\\n}\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494721489,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"exec\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494721494_gt8sd\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie: [TOOL] {\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"TASK_ACTION\\\",\\n  \\\"arguments\\\": {\\n    \\\"a...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494721494,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494721503_zcdvk\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"Executing [TOOL] {\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"TASK_ACTION\\\",\\n  \\\"arguments\\\": {\\n    \\\"action\\\": \\\"update\\\",\\n    \\\"id\\\": \\\"task_1772493894762\\\",\\n    \\\"status\\\": \\\"in_progress\\\",\\n    \\\"progress\\\": 50,\\n    \\\"subtasks\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"id\\\": \\\"fix_json\\\",\\n        \\\"t