odpowiedź odebrana (14s)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494858630,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494858650_m0h05\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494858650,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494858665_u0dhw\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"- Analyzing Current Tool Performance\\n- I see that \\\"Autonomia: Samorozwój (loopbreaker)\\\" is progressing, currently at 40%. It is clear that the high-level tools are not working at all, while the SHELL tool is the most successful, having 67% success. My focus is now on understanding the root cause of these failures.\\n- Debugging JSON Malformations\\n- I'm now zeroing in on the JSON errors in apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json. My attempts with node -e failed, likely due to shell escaping problems with nested quotes. The file has missing and misplaced HTML tags and quotes. The latest plan is to use PYTHONEXEC and base64 to write the fixed content, as per the support hint. The subtasks are still: patchscript pending, and verifystability pending.\\n- Refining Fix Strategy\\n- I've decided to re-fix apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json with a robust Python and base64 approach, or directly write the string, to sidestep the quoting issues. I'll then validate index.json using Python as well. Next, I'll review scripts/amazonlinkchecker.cjs's 503 error handling, although it seems it's already implemented there. I must verify the logic. Finally, I will update all subtasks and their progress. I will then review the content of apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json again.\\n- Evaluating Ultra 2's Merits\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494858665,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"thought\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494858671_cenna\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494858671,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494858688_5xwbz\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie: [SHELL] \\\"cat << 'EOF' > data/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494858688,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494858697_hshl1\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"Executing [SHELL] \\\"cat << 'EOF' > data/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json\\n{\\n  \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"apple-watch-ultra-2-review\\\\\\\",\\n  \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Apple Watch Ultra 2 Review: The Ultimate Rugged Smartwatch\\\\\\\",\\n  \\\\\\\"subtitle\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Comprehensive review of Apple's most advanced outdoor smartwatch for adventurers and athletes\\\\\\\",\\n  \\\\\\\"author\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Technova Team\\\\\\\",\\n  \\\\\\\"date\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"2025-01-15\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"category\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"REVIEWS\\\\\\\",\\n  \\\\\\\"tags\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Tech\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Apple\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wearables\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Smartwatch\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Fitness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Accessories\\\\\\\"],\\n  \\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"images/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-main.jpg\\\\\\\",\\n  \\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"<p>The Apple Watch Ultra 2 represents the pinnacle of wearable technology for adventurers and athletes. Building upon the original Ultra success, this second-generation model brings refinements in performance, display brightness, and sustainability.</p><h2>Design and Build Quality</h2><p>The Ultra 2 maintains the distinctive 49mm titanium case. The aerospace-grade titanium is both lightweight and incredibly durable, capable of withstanding extreme conditions from deep-sea diving to mountain climbing.</p><h2>Display: Brighter Than Ever</h2><p>The Always-On Retina display now reaches 3000 nits of peak brightness, making it easily readable even in direct sunlight. The sapphire crystal front provides exceptional scratch resistance.</p><h2>Performance and Battery Life</h2><p>Powered by the S9 SiP chip, the Ultra 2 delivers smooth performance for all tasks. Battery life extends up to 36 hours in normal use and up to 72 hours in Low Power Mode.</p><h2>Where to Buy</h2><div class='product-recommendation'><h3>Check Price on Amazon</h3><p><a href='https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CHX3TW6T?tag=kimsondreams-21' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>Buy Apple Watch Ultra 2 on Amazon</a></p></div>\\\\\\\"\\n}\\nEOF\\n\\\"\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494858697,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"exec\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494858707_puj95\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"[SYSTEM/ERROR] Autonomous Kernel Error (ollama): Cannot read properties of null (reading 'code')\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494858707,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494858717_v75a5\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Błąd: Cannot read properties of null (reading 'code')\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494858717,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494873144_s8kem\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"[SYSTEM/INFO] Autonomy Tick\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494873144,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494873162_y27kh\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Start cyklu autonomii\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494873162,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494873176_d3ma2\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie zadania: Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494873176,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,