n- Verifying System Stability\\n- I'm now focused on verifying system stability as a prerequisite to unblocking high-level tools. The plan involves patching amazonlinkchecker.cjs for robust 503 error handling, although the initial implementation seems to account for it. I will review the existing code's logic and determine if additional logging or warnings are needed to improve it. After this patch, my goal is to execute a high-level tool successfully or validate all critical files.\\n- Refining 503 Handling\\n- I'm focused on improving 503 error handling in amazonlinkchecker.cjs. The existing code acknowledges 503s as \\\"ok,\\\" but I will enhance it by logging specific warnings for them, differentiating them from standard 200 responses. This will be done using PYTHONEXEC to read and modify scripts/amazonlinkchecker.cjs. I plan to introduce a is503 flag for more informative logging. I believe the last PYTHONEXEC was successful, as no errors were returned.\\n- Evaluating Code Behavior\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494917986,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"thought\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494917992_drqj5\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494917992,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494918018_3id0g\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Ostrzeżenie: brak narzędzi w odpowiedzi\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494918018,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494920269_inndk\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"AUTONOMY BLOCKED: TOOL success rate 0%. Choose alternative.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494920269,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494920293_nlmxv\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie: [WEB_SE