ania się sobą, proces realizacji siebie, swych możliwości. Zmienianie się przez\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"Break Toxic Relationship Loops | Free Loop Breaker Guide — Phoenix ...\\\",\\n    \\\"link\\\": \\\"https://www.phoenixpathway.com/loop-breaker-guide\\\",\\n    \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Break the loop that keeps breaking you. You're not failing. You're stuck in a pattern. The Loop Breaker Guide shows you how to stop repeating cycles of self-silencing and reclaim your identity in relationships.\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"RP329: Samorozwój - Nie dajmy się zwariować! - Learn Polish Language ...\\\",\\n    \\\"link\\\": \\\"https://realpolish.pl/rp329-samorozwoj/\\\",\\n    \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"RP329: Samorozwój - Nie dajmy się zwariować! This podcast is about learning Polish naturally. Please listen, and read transcription to improve your Polish understanding. This time I want to talk about self improvement industry. I don't know about you, but I sometimes don't believe in all hints that we find in self improvement books and ...\\\"\\n  }\\n]\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494920310,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494921343_swc2x\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"[SYSTEM/INFO] Autonomy Tick\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494921343,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494921361_deimf\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Start cyklu autonomii\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494921361,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494921374_mwwdf\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie zadania: Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494921374,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494921386_0tgjg\",\n  