83,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494975893_uvbem\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"AUTONOMY BLOCKED: TOOL success rate 0%. Choose alternative.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494975893,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494975908_5coss\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"SYSTEM: Resetting stats for TOOL to give it a fresh start.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494975908,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494975917_2qurv\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"AUTONOMY BLOCKED: TOOL success rate 0%. Choose alternative.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494975917,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494975927_c55fh\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie: [TOOL] {\\\"action\\\": \\\"PYTHON_EXEC\\\", \\\"code\\\": \\\"import json\\\\nim...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494975927,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494975936_rbg2m\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"Executing [TOOL] {\\\"action\\\": \\\"PYTHON_EXEC\\\", \\\"code\\\": \\\"import json\\\\nimport os\\\\n\\\\ndata = {\\\\n  \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"apple-watch-ultra-2-review\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Apple Watch Ultra 2 Review: The Ultimate Rugged Smartwatch\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"subtitle\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Comprehensive review of Apple's most advanced outdoor smartwatch for adventurers and athletes\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"author\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Technova Team\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"date\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"2025-01-15\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"category\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"REVIEWS\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"tags\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Tech\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Apple\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wearables\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Smartwatch\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Fitness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Accessories\\\\\\\"],\\\\n  \\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"images/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-main.jpg\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"<p>The Apple Watch Ultra 2 represents the pinnacle of wearable technology for adventurers and athletes. Building upon the original Ultra success, this second-generation model brings refinements in performance, display brightness, and sustainability.</p><h2>Design and Build Quality</h2><p>The Ultra 2 maintains the distinctive 49mm titanium case. The aerospace-grade titanium is both lightweight and incredibly durable, capable of withstanding extreme conditions from deep-sea diving to mountain climbing.</p><h2>Display: Brighter Than Ever</h2><p>The Always-On Retina display now reaches 3000 nits of peak brightness, making it easily readable even in direct sunlight. The sapphire crystal front provides exceptional scratch resistance.</p><h2>Performance and Battery Life</h2><p>Powered by the S9 SiP chip, the Ultra 2 delivers smooth performance for all tasks. Battery life extends up to 36 hours in normal use and up to 72 hours in Low Power Mode.</p><h2>Where to Buy</h2><div class='product-recommendation'><h3>Check Price on Amazon</h3><p><a href='https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CHX3TW6T?tag=kimsondreams-21' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>Buy Apple Watch Ultra 2 on Amazon</a></p></div>\\\\\\\"\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\npath = 'data/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json'\\\\nwith open(path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\\\\n    json.dump(data, f, indent=2)\\\\n\\\\nprint(f'Successfully repaired {path} with valid JSON and HTML')\\\\n\\\"}\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494975936,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"exec\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494976961_uf66a\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"[SYSTEM/INFO] Autonomy Tick\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494976961,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494976978_peneb\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Start cyklu autonomii\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494976978,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494976992_tsuok\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie zadania: Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494976992,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494977003_y5qb1\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Model: deepseek-v3.2:cloud (Role: architecture)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494977003,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494977040_2uy3x\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Support hint requested for active task: Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494977040,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494982845_pdg6l\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Support idea: SUPPORT_HINT: Stop the web searches. Use `PYTHON_EXEC` to read and modify `scripts/amazonlinkchecker.cjs` directly to implement the 503 warning logic and unblock the system.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494982845,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494982862_pkivn\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Ollama: oczekiwanie na odpowiedź\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494982862,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772494986507_0jtkc\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Pominięcie: akcja w toku\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772494986507,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495002094_ho2m8\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Ollama: odpowiedź odebrana (19s)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495002094,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495002110_m8l3t\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495002110,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495002122_f6d1q\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"- Assessing Task Progress\\n- I've noted that \\\"Autonomia: Samorozwój\\\" is 60% complete. The JSON and index validations are done. My next focus is on the pending patchscript subtask, specifically the amazonlink patch.\\n- Refining Error Handling\\n- I'm now focused on error handling within amazonlinkchecker.cjs. I'm going to attempt reading the script via PYTHONEXEC to identify the 503 error handling code. The existing tools have shown varied success rates. My next step will be modifying the script to treat 503 errors as warnings rather than outright blockers. The high-level tools' failure points to underlying script issues.\\n- Analyzing Script Modification\\n- I'm now diving into modifying the amazonlinkchecker.cjs script. I'm leveraging PYTHONEXEC for reliable multi-line string manipulation. I'm focusing on the checkUrlStatus function to better handle 503 errors. The aim is to differentiate them within the existing function to improve link status detection.\\n- Implementing Python Modification\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495002122,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"thought\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495002128_0wtay\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495002128,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495002143_puwx4\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie: [TOOL] {\\\"action\\\": \\\"PYTHON_EXEC\\\", \\\"code\\\": \\\"import os\\\\n\\\\npa...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495002143,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495002152_o551g\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"Executing [TOOL] {\\\"action\\\": \\\"PYTHON_EXEC\\\", \\\"code\\\": \\\"import os\\\\n\\\\npath = 'scripts/amazon_link_checker.cjs'\\\\nwith open(path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\\\\n    content = f.read()\\\\n\\\\n# 1. Update checkUrlStatus to return isWarning for 503\\\\nold_func = \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"function checkUrlStatus(url, timeout = 5000) {\\\\n  return new Promise((resolve) => {\\\\n    const protocol = url.startsWith('https') ? https : http;\\\\n    const req = protocol.get(url, { timeout }, (res) => {\\\\n      resolve({ status: res.statusCode, ok: (res.statusCode >= 200 && res.statusCode < 400) || res.statusCode === 503 });\\\\n    });\\\\n    req.on('error', () => resolve({ status: 0, ok: false, error: true }));\\\\n    req.on('timeout', () => { req.destroy(); resolve({ status: 0, ok: false, timeout: true }); });\\\\n  });\\\\n}\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nnew_func = \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"function checkUrlStatus(url, timeout = 5000) {\\\\n  return new Promise((resolve) => {\\\\n    const protocol = url.startsWith('https') ? https : http;\\\\n    const req = protocol.get(url, { timeout }, (res) => {\\\\n      const is503 = res.statusCode === 503;\\\\n      resolve({\\\\n        status: res.statusCode,\\\\n        ok: (res.statusCode >= 200 && res.statusCode < 400) || is503,\\\\n        isWarning: is503\\\\n      });\\\\n    });\\\\n    req.on('error', () => resolve({ status: 0, ok: false, error: true }));\\\\n    req.on('timeout', () => { req.destroy(); resolve({ status: 0, ok: false, timeout: true }); });\\\\n  });\\\\n}\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\ncontent = content.replace(old_func, new_func)\\\\n\\\\n# 2. Update the loop to log 503 as a warning\\\\nold_loop = \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"          const status = await checkUrlStatus(link.url);\\\\n          if (!status.ok) {\\\\n            issues.push('Broken link (' + status.status + '): ' + link.url);\\\\n            results.brokenLinks++;\\\\n          } else {\\\\n            results.validLinks++;\\\\n          }\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nnew_loop = \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"          const status = await checkUrlStatus(link.url);\\\\n          if (status.isWarning) {\\\\n            issues.push('Warning: Amazon 503 (Service Unavailable) - Link might be valid but throttled: ' + link.url);\\\\n            results.validLinks++;\\\\n          } else if (!status.ok) {\\\\n            issues.push('Broken link (' + status.status + '): ' + link.url);\\\\n            results.brokenLinks++;\\\\n          } else {\\\\n            results.validLinks++;\\\\n          }\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\ncontent = content.replace(old_loop, new_loop)\\\\n\\\\nwith open(path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\\\\n    f.write(content)\\\\n\\\\nprint(f'Successfully patched {path} to handle 503 warnings.')\\\\n\\\"}\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495002152,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"exec\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495002157_qiv09\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie: [TOOL] {\\\"action\\\": \\\"TASK_ACTION\\\", \\\"action_type\\\": \\\"update\\\",...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495002157,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495002166_egkz1\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"Executing [TOOL] {\\\"action\\\": \\\"TASK_ACTION\\\", \\\"action_type\\\": \\\"update\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"task_1772493894762\\\", \\\"progress\\\": 80, \\\"log\\\": \\\"Patched scripts/amazon_link_checker.cjs to handle 503 errors as warnings. This prevents the script from flagging temporary Amazon throttling as broken links while still alerting the user. Moving to system stability verification.\\\", \\\"subtasks\\\": [{\\\"id\\\": \\\"fix_json\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"Fix malformed JSON in apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json\\\", \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\"}, {\\\"id\\\": \\\"validate_index\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"Validate index.json integrity\\\", \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\"}, {\\\"id\\\": \\\"patch_script\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"Patch amazon_link_checker.cjs for robust 503 handling\\\", \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\"}, {\\\"id\\\": \\\"verify_stability\\\", \\\"title\\\": \\\"Verify system stability and unblock high-level tools\\\", \\\"status\\\": \\\"pending\\\"}]}\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495002166,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"exec\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495003200_aclmc\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"[SYSTEM/INFO] Autonomy Tick\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495003200,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495003218_vf74a\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Start cyklu autonomii\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495003218,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495003232_9min2\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Loop breaker (aggressive): zatrzymanie zadania\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495003232,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495003244_yap29\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"[SYSTEM/WARN] Autonomous Loop Detected (Aggressive). Halting current task.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495003244,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495016558_fw16r\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"[SYSTEM/INFO] Autonomy Tick\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495016558,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n   