n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495105330_3mhj3\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"- Reviewing Project Autonomia\\n- I'm currently focused on the \\\"Autonomia: Samorozwój\\\" task (loopbreaker), aiming to reconcile a reported 80% progress (from the last handover) with a snapshot at 60%. I completed fixjson and validateindex subtasks. The patch subtask is underway, but I need to integrate its output to accurately assess the current state.\\n- Confirming Write Operation\\n- I believe the recent FILEWRITE operation to data/out/stabilitytest.txt is the key. If it succeeded, I can declare the loop-breaker task complete. Currently, I'm checking the logs to confirm the output, and I'll update the project progress accordingly. The logs indicate progress, and the JSON and link check are confirmed.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495105330,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"thought\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495105336_2kblq\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495105336,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495105353_14p8p\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"AUTONOMY BLOCKED: TOOL success rate 0%. Choose alternative.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495105353,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495105362_qyiyz\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"AUTONOMY BLOCKED: TOOL success rate 0%. Choose alternative.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495105362,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495105377_b5qet\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"AUTONOMY BLOCKED: TOOL success rate 0%. Choose alternative.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495105377,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\