 \"timestamp\": 1772495424182,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495429433_772q4\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Support idea: SUPPORT_HINT: Try `FILE_WRITE` to `data/out/stability_test.txt`. If it succeeds, the block is lifted; then mark the task as 100% complete and resume the main audit.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495429433,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495429443_tpneo\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Ollama: oczekiwanie na odpowiedź\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495429443,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495451248_0uxgl\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Ollama: odpowiedź odebrana (21s)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495451248,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495451262_nq4zk\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495451262,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495451275_i7brn\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"- Analyzing Loop Condition\\n- Okay, I've confirmed a \\\"loop breaker\\\" state for task1772493894762. My high-level tools are blocked, and the success rate is zero. It's a classic impasse, I'm working to identify the specific root cause of this blockage, and the process to clear the loop and restore function.\\n- Confirming Current State\\n- I'm now focusing on verifying the integrity of apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json and double-checking the 503 handling in amazonlinkchecker.cjs. My plan is to signal recovery by creating a stability test file using functional tools like PYTHONEXEC or SHELL. It looks like the grep output gives clues toward a positive response. Once these steps are complete, I'll finalize the task by marking the subtasks as complete.\\n- Refining Robustness Protocols\\n- Okay, I'm now zeroing in on an anomaly: malformed HTML within apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json. A missing '>' and an apostrophe are causing the JSON to be improperly formatted. My next steps involve using PYTHONEXEC to correctly fix the file and avoid further escaping issues, after which I will patch the script to log a warning for 503 errors and create a stability test file. I'm seeing that I missed a step; fixing the JSON properly is still pending. I will revisit that.\\n- Implementing File Updates\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495451275,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"thought\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495451281_0h7ms\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495451281,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495451296_yaccd\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie: [TOOL] {\\\"name\\\": \\\"PYTHON_EXEC\\\", \\\"arguments\\\": {\\\"code\\\": \\\"imp...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495451296,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495451307_7lc33\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"Executing [TOOL] {\\\"name\\\": \\\"PYTHON_EXEC\\\", \\\"arguments\\\": {\\\"code\\\": \\\"import json\\\\nimport os\\\\n\\\\n# 1. Fix JSON\\\\narticle_path = \\\\\\\"data/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-review.json\\\\\\\"\\\\narticle_data = {\\\\n    \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"apple-watch-ultra-2-review\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Apple Watch Ultra 2 Review: The Ultimate Rugged Smartwatch\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"subtitle\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Comprehensive review of Apple's most advanced outdoor smartwatch for adventurers and athletes\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"author\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Technova Team\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"date\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"2025-01-15\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"category\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"REVIEWS\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"tags\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Tech\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Apple\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wearables\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Smartwatch\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Fitness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Accessories\\\\\\\"],\\\\n    \\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"images/articles/apple-watch-ultra-2-main.jpg\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"<p>The Apple Watch Ultra 2 represents the pinnacle of wearable technology for adventurers and athletes. Building upon the original Ultra success, this second-generation model brings refinements in performance, display brightness, and sustainability.</p><h2>Design and Build Quality</h2><p>The Ultra 2 maintains the distinctive 49mm titanium case. The aerospace-grade titanium is both lightweight and incredibly durable, capable of withstanding extreme conditions from deep-sea diving to mountain climbing.</p><h2>Display: Brighter Than Ever</h2><p>The Always-On Retina display now reaches 3000 nits of peak brightness, making it easily readable even in direct sunlight. The sapphire crystal front provides exceptional scratch resistance.</p><h2>Performance and Battery Life</h2><p>Powered by the S9 SiP chip, the Ultra 2 delivers smooth performance for all tasks. Battery life extends up to 36 hours in normal use and up to 72 hours in Low Power Mode.</p><h2>Where to Buy</h2><div class='product-recommendation'><h3>Check Price on Amazon</h3><p><a href='https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CHX3TW6T?tag=kimsondreams-21' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>Buy Apple Watch Ultra 2 on Amazon</a></p></div>\\\\\\\"\\\\n}\\\\nwith open(article_path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\\\\n    json.dump(article_data, f, indent=2)\\\\n\\\\n# 2. Patch Script\\\\nscript_path = \\\\\\\"scripts/amazon_link_checker.cjs\\\\\\\"\\\\nif os.path.exists(script_path):\\\\n    with open(script_path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\\\\n        content = f.read()\\\\n\\\\n  