ing upon the original Ultra success, this second-generation model brings refinements in performance, display brightness, and sustainability.</p><h2>Design and Build Quality</h2><p>The Ultra 2 maintains the distinctive 49mm titanium case. The aerospace-grade titanium is both lightweight and incredibly durable, capable of withstanding extreme conditions from deep-sea diving to mountain climbing.</p><h2>Display: Brighter Than Ever</h2><p>The Always-On Retina display now reaches 3000 nits of peak brightness, making it easily readable even in direct sunlight. The sapphire crystal front provides exceptional scratch resistance.</p><h2>Performance and Battery Life</h2><p>Powered by the S9 SiP chip, the Ultra 2 delivers smooth performance for all tasks. Battery life extends up to 36 hours in normal use and up to 72 hours in Low Power Mode.</p><h2>Where to Buy</h2><div class='product-recommendation'><h3>Check Price on Amazon</h3><p><a href='https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CHX3TW6T?tag=kimsondreams-21' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>Buy Apple Watch Ultra 2 on Amazon</a></p></div>\\\\\\\"\\\\n}\\\\nwith open(article_path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\\\\n    json.dump(article_data, f, indent=2)\\\\n\\\\n# 2. Patch scripts/amazon_link_checker.cjs to add warning for 503\\\\nscript_path = \\\\\\\"scripts/amazon_link_checker.cjs\\\\\\\"\\\\nif os.path.exists(script_path):\\\\n    with open(script_path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\\\\n        content = f.read()\\\\n\\\\n    if \\\\\\\"res.statusCode === 503\\\\\\\" in content and \\\\\\\"console.warn\\\\\\\" not in content:\\\\n        patched = content.replace(\\\\n            \\\\\\\"resolve({ status: res.statusCode, ok: (res.statusCode >= 200 && res.statusCode < 400) || res.statusCode === 503 });\\\\\\\",\\\\n            \\\\\\\"if (res.statusCode === 503) console.warn(`[AMAZON_CHECKER] 503 Service Unavailable for ${url}`); resolve({ status: res.statusCode, ok: (res.statusCode >= 200 && res.statusCode < 400) || res.statusCode === 50