erforming and supporting your business goals.\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"Content Audit Checklist: How to Conduct an Audit for Your Site\\\",\\n    \\\"link\\\": \\\"https://www.clearvoice.com/resources/step-by-step-guide-to-content-audits/\\\",\\n    \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Broken links, outdated or redundant content, content not performing as expected, rebranding—these are just some of the reasons why a content audit might be in order. But what is a content audit, exactly? Understanding Content Audits: The Essentials A content audit is a comprehensive review and analysis of all the content your company owns. This includes web pages, blog posts, social media ...\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"How to Run a Blog Content Audit (5-Step Framework)\\\",\\n    \\\"link\\\": \\\"https://www.ontoplist.com/blog/audit-blog-content/\\\",\\n    \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Learn how to run a blog content audit in 5 steps. Find underperforming posts, fix SEO issues, and boost organic traffic with this actionable guide.\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"Digital Content Audit Guide: Fix Content Decay, SEO Gaps & Broken Links ...\\\",\\n    \\\"link\\\": \\\"https://sunbposolutions.com/digital-content-audit-guide/\\\",\\n    \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Struggling with falling traffic and outdated blog posts? Learn how a digital content audit can help fix content decay, SEO content gaps, and broken web links to boost rankings and engagement in 2025.\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"What is a Blog Content Audit? (and Why Your Website Needs One)\\\",\\n    \\\"link\\\": \\\"https://marketinginsidergroup.com/content-marketing/what-is-a-blog-content-audit-and-why-your-website-needs-one/\\\",\\n    \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Quick Takeaways A blog content audit reviews existing blog posts to assess performance, accuracy, and relevance. You'll find gaps in your content and outdated posts that need updates or removal. Content audits help improve SEO, engagement, and lead generation. An audit gives you a clear plan to reuse and improve your best-performing content.\\\"\\n  }\\n]\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495852413,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495853461_kiqtt\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"[SYSTEM/INFO] Autonomy Tick\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495853461,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495853481_w60nq\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Start cyklu autonomii\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495853481,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495853495_mwj87\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Loop breaker (aggressive): zatrzymanie zadania\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495853495,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495853508_t912y\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"[SYSTEM/WARN] Autonomous Loop Detected (Aggressive). Halting current task.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495853508,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495860845_zdo56\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"[SYSTEM/INFO] Autonomy Tick\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495860845,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495860865_vrj7n\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Start cyklu autonomii\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495860865,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772495860880_rtph7\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Start zadania: Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772495860880,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"