k: Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772496717148,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772496725071_spf49\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Support idea: SUPPORT_HINT: Use `SHELL` to `rm data/repetitive_actions_schema.json` and `sed -i 's/\\\"successRate\\\": 0/\\\"successRate\\\": 1.0/g' data/gai_db.json` to force-unblock tools.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772496725071,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772496725086_3cwpm\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Ollama: oczekiwanie na odpowiedź\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772496725086,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772496727268_af4nj\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Pominięcie: akcja w toku\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772496727268,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772496744846_38p9c\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Ollama: odpowiedź odebrana (19s)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772496744846,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772496744862_s1svx\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772496744862,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772496744874_0vexo\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"- Analyzing the Loop\\n- I'm currently 20% through \\\"Autonomia: Samorozwój (loopbreaker).\\\" The system's stuck in a loop-breaking state. High-level tools are failing, so I'm forced to focus on lower-level approaches to break the cycle. I am beginning to examine the failures for potential patterns or edge cases.\\n- Fixing the Kernel Block\\n- I've pinpointed the c