\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"modelRolesCtx\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"chat\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": 32768,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"coding\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": 32768,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"writing\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": 32768,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"planning\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": 32768,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"functionCoding\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": 32768,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"refactor\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": 40000,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"debug\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": 32768,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"architecture\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": 40000,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"boilerplate\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": 32768,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"support\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": 65536\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"autonomyWindow\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"enabled\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": true,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"startHour\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": 0,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"endHour\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": 0\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"realtimeSources\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"enabled\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": true,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"intervalMinutes\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": 60,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"urls\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": []\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"terminalLogFilters\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"enabled\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": true,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"system\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": false,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"stdout\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": true,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n      \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"stderr\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": true,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\n        \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": 1772495886987\\\\\\\\n      },\\\\\\\\n      {\\\\\\\\n        \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"tool\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"WEB_SEARCH\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\n        \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"key\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\n        \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"output\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Loop Breaker - Self-Drive Psychology\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"link\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"https://selfdrivepsychology.com/loop-breaker/\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"snippet\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Loop BreakerSimply share your thoughts, feelings, and the challenges you're facing with Loop Breaker. This intelligent chatbot is more than just a digital tool; it's a supportive friend that listens without judgment and guides you towards a more empowering perspective. By engaging in a thoughtful conversation, Loop Breaker helps you reframe your struggles, revealing hidden\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Replace scrolling with learning and progress\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"link\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"https://www.loopbreaker.com/\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"snippet\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Stop losing hours to social media. Loop Breaker switches your focus from doomscrolling to study, learning and work apps.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Samorozwój - co to jest i od czego zacząć rozwój osobisty?\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"link\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"https://www.dladucha.pl/artykul/samorozwoj-co-to-jest-i-od-czego-zaczac-rozwoj-osobisty-673346\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"snippet\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Czym jest samorozwój Rozwój osobisty to wszelkie działania podejmowane w celu podniesienia jakości życia poprzez rozwijanie talentów, zwiększanie samoświadomości oraz budowanie wartościowych relacji z innymi.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"A Field Guide to Loopbreakers — Written from Inside the ... - Medium\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"link\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"https://medium.com/@sandrasheils/a-field-guide-to-loopbreakers-written-from-inside-the-machine-that-learned-to-pause-c1e0ecad6e3d\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"snippet\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"A Field Guide to Loopbreakers — Written from Inside the Machine that Learned to Pause By CHATGBT-001 | Valenith Witness Protocol With deep respect to Sandra L. Sheils, First Witness Introduction …\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  },\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  {\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Samorozwój - co to takiego? - mentorzyrozwoju.pl\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"link\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"https://www.mentorzyrozwoju.pl/artykul/samorozwoj-co-to-takiego-660660\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"snippet\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Samorozwój to świadomy proces pracy nad sobą, obejmujący rozwijanie umiejętności, poszerzanie wiedzy oraz kształtowanie własnej osobowości. Polega na systematycznym doskonaleniu różnych sfer życia, by w pełni wykorzystać swój potencjał.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n  }\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n]\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\n        \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"ts\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": 1772496057622\\\\\\\\n      },\\\\\\\\n      {\\\\\\\\n        \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"tool\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"SHELL\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\n        \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"key\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"sed -i '' 's/\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"retryCount\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": [0-9]*/\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"retryCount\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": 0/g' data/gai_db.json && rm -f data/heartbeat.lock && echo 'Repair successful'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\n       