hese operations, potentially based on the data contained in the 'data/' directory, while SHELL and PYTHONEXEC remain unaffected. I'm focusing on why specific tools are being denied.\\n- Reconstructing Core Data\\n- I'm now focused on rebuilding a valid gaidb.json file. My objective is to ensure the current \\\"Autonomia: Samorozwój (loopbreaker)\\\" task is correctly represented, as it seems to be missing following the resets. I will make sure the file contains the relevant task information. The progress for my current task is 30% complete, and is centered around data integrity.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772497750413,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"thought\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772497750422_n26z9\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772497750422,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772497750443_5zj5y\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie: [TOOL] {\\\"name\\\": \\\"PYTHON_EXEC\\\", \\\"arguments\\\": {\\\"code\\\": \\\"imp...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772497750443,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772497750458_tiwbx\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"Executing [TOOL] {\\\"name\\\": \\\"PYTHON_EXEC\\\", \\\"arguments\\\": {\\\"code\\\": \\\"import json\\\\nimport os\\\\n\\\\npath = 'data/gai_db.json'\\\\n\\\\n# Reconstruct a healthy database state\\\\ntasks = [\\\\n    {\\\\n        \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"task_1772495853518\\\\\\\",\\\\n        \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\\\\\\\",\\\\n        \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Cel: usunąć przyczynę blokady i poprawić strategię autonomii.\\\\\\\",\\\\n        \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"in_progress\\\\\\\",\\\\n        \\\\\\\"progress\\\\\\\": 35,\\\\n        \\\\\\\"priority\\\\\\\": \\\\