: \"WEB_SEARCH RESULTS:\\n[\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"Are room-temperature superconductors finally within reach?\\\",\\n    \\\"link\\\": \\\"https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2025/10/251030075132.htm\\\",\\n    \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Their model bridges classical superconductivity theory with quantum mechanics through zentropy theory. This breakthrough could guide the discovery of powerful, resistance-free materials for real ...\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"Room-Temperature Superconductors in 2025: Real Breakthrough or Hype?\\\",\\n    \\\"link\\\": \\\"https://physicsqanda.com/room-temperature-superconductors-in-2025/\\\",\\n    \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Room-temperature superconductors in 2025: a clear, science-backed update on the breakthrough, its potential, and what still needs verification.\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"In a first, researchers stabilize a promising new class of high ...\\\",\\n    \\\"link\\\": \\\"https://www6.slac.stanford.edu/news/2025-02-04-first-researchers-stabilize-promising-new-class-high-temperature-superconductors\\\",\\n    \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Researchers have made a significant step in the study of a new class of high-temperature superconductors: creating superconductors that work at room pressure. That advance lays the groundwork for deeper exploration of these materials, bringing us closer to real-world applications such as lossless power grids and advanced quantum technologies. Superconductivity, the ability of certain materials ...\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"Breakthrough in Superconductor Research Brings Room-Temperature Dreams ...\\\",\\n    \\\"link\\\": \\\"https://thedebrief.org/breakthrough-in-superconductor-research-brings-room-temperature-dreams-closer-to-reality/\\\",\\n    \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\"To develop a superconductor that works at room temperature is really the dream,\\\\\\\" says Dean. \\\\\\\"Our discovery could very well be the key that makes this dream a reality.\\\\\\\" The paper \\\\\\\" Superconductivity in 5.0° Twisted Bilayer WSe 2 \\\\\\\" appeared in Nature on January 22, 2025. Ryan Whalen covers science and technology for The Debrief.\\\"\\n  },\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"Superconductivity achieved at room temperature- Earth.com\\\",\\n    \\\"link\\\": \\\"https://www.earth.com/news/superconductivity-achieved-at-room-temperature-with-new-materials/\\\",\\n    \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"High-temperature superconductivity High-temperature superconductivity first caught global attention in the late 1980s with cuprates. Alhough they broke temperature records at the time, these substances still demanded cold conditions that limit daily use.\\\"\\n  }\\n]\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498219257,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498220309_6gsa0\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"[SYSTEM/INFO] Autonomy Tick\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498220309,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498220332_h206p\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Start cyklu autonomii\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498220332,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498220350_xrogp\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie zadania: Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498220350,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498220365_933pw\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Model: deepseek-v3.2:cloud (Role: architecture)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498220365,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498220404_iv4bb\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Support hint requested for active task: Autonomia: Samorozwó