j osobowości. Polega na systematycznym doskonaleniu różnych sfer życia, by w pełni wykorzystać swój potencjał.\\\"\\n  }\\n]\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498771836,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498772879_7xm8w\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"[SYSTEM/INFO] Autonomy Tick\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498772879,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498772903_ar39v\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Start cyklu autonomii\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498772903,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498772921_9tb0v\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie zadania: Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498772921,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498772936_m5xe9\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Model: deepseek-v3.2:cloud (Role: architecture)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498772936,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498772976_6324s\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Support hint requested for active task: Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498772976,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498783898_rcjm1\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Support idea: SUPPORT_HINT: Use `PYTHON_EXEC` to read and print the contents of `data/gai_db.json` and `.gaios/loop_config.json` to verify if your manual resets are being immediately reverted by a background proces…\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498783898,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498783919_y04pc\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Ollama: oczekiwanie na odpowiedź\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498783919,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498801867_iyuvb\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Pominięcie: akcja w toku\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498801867,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498829756_rtxf3\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Ollama: odpowiedź odebrana (45s)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498829756,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498829774_gw0a6\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498829774,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498829790_kq53a\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"- Analyzing the Persistent Loop\\n- I've observed a critical issue: the system is stuck. High-level tools consistently fail, trapped in a \\\"loop breaker\\\" state. Tools like FILEWRITE, WEBREAD, and TASKACTION are blocked, achieving a 0% success rate. The SHELL tool, however, is not blocked.\\n- Investigating the Contradiction\\n- I'm now focusing on a contradiction within the tool data. I see a FILEREAD with zero success in TOOLSTATS, yet a successful FILEREAD in the RECENTTOOLCACHE. This suggests the TOOLSTATS may be a lagged indicator or only reflects the current, blocked state, while the cache shows past successful executions. I will continue to test my initial plan to see if I can unblock myself.\\n- Devising the Unblock Strategy\\n- I've shifted my focus to the loop-breaking task itself. The SUPPORTHINT suggested PYTHONEXEC which is the key. I will use it for \\\"surgical\\\" modifications to the database. First, I will read the configs using SHELL, then use PYTHONEXEC to perform a \\\"clean\\\" write. I'm focusing on the current task and its requirements instead of the listed audit subtasks. Finally, I will remove any relevant lock files.\\n- Defining the Desired State\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498829790,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"thought\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498829797_rk3l7\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498829797,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498829832_ef6wy\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Ostrzeżenie: brak narzędzi w odpowiedzi\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498829832,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498831917_rfa8l\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"AUTONOMY BLOCKED: TOOL success rate 0%. Choose alternative.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498831917,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498831943_b7brl\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie: [WEB_SEARCH] Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498831943,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498831957_xyvhe\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"Executing [WEB_SEARCH] Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498831957,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"exec\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498831964_c7kiw\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"WEB_SEARCH RESULTS (cache):\\n[\\n  {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"Loop Breaker - Self-Drive Psychology\\\",\\n    \\\"link\\\": \\\"https://selfdrivepsychology.com/loop-breaker/\\\",\\n    \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Loop BreakerSimply share your thoug