ejętności, poszerzanie wiedzy oraz kształtowanie własnej osobowości. Polega na systematycznym doskonaleniu różnych sfer życia, by w pełni wykorzystać swój potencjał.\\\"\\n  }\\n]\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498944718,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498945761_idt04\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"[SYSTEM/INFO] Autonomy Tick\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498945761,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498945776_5ltru\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Start cyklu autonomii\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498945776,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498945792_f0w87\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie zadania: Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498945792,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498945807_4upcn\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Model: deepseek-v3.2:cloud (Role: architecture)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498945807,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498945848_qjcpu\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Support hint requested for active task: Autonomia: Samorozwój (loop_breaker)\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498945848,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498951581_5wf5e\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Support idea: SUPPORT_HINT: Use `SHELL` to `rm -f .gaios/loop_config.json` and `data/repetitive_actions_schema.json`, then `echo` a minimal valid JSON into `data/gai_db.json` to bypass `PYTHON_EXEC` blocks.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498951581,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": 