which suggests manual modification is now the only option. I will now follow the plan to eliminate the loop.\\n- Restoring the Database\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498967771,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"thought\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498967778_k1auq\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Analiza odpowiedzi...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498967778,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498967800_i56e5\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"AUTONOMY BLOCKED: TOOL success rate 0%. Choose alternative.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498967800,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498967814_8iy0p\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"SYSTEM: Resetting stats for TOOL to give it a fresh start.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498967814,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498967828_ylydi\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"AUTONOMY BLOCKED: TOOL success rate 0%. Choose alternative.\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498967828,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498967842_my4mn\",\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"text\": \"STAGE: Wykonywanie: [TOOL] {\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"FILE_READ\\\",\\n  \\\"arguments\\\": {\\n    \\\"pat...\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498967842,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"system\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498967856_kupeo\",\n      \"role\": \"model\",\n      \"text\": \"Executing [TOOL] {\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"FILE_READ\\\",\\n  \\\"arguments\\\": {\\n    \\\"path\\\": \\\"data/gai_db.json\\\"\\n  }\\n}\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1772498967856,\n      \"isAutonomous\": true,\n      \"logType\": \"exec\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"msg_1772498968666_fj1i1\",\n 