      "content": "The user is asking why I'm not working. Looking at the system status and logs, I can see there have been some issues:\n\n1. There's an \"Autonomous Loop Detected (Aggressive). Halting current task.\" message in the logs\n2. There are repeated model timing logs showing long response times (25-30+ seconds TTFB)\n3. There's a corrupted output pattern visible: \"Amazon to purchase on Amazon to purchase on...\" repeating many times - this indicates a model generation failure/loop\n4. The system shows \"action=idle\" and \"task=none\" currently\n\nThe user is right to notice something is off. I should:\n1. Acknowledge the issue honestly\n2. Explain what happened (model loop/generation failure detected)\n3. Confirm I'm now operational and ready to help\n4. Keep it brief as per the user contract (\"Zawsze odpowiadaj krótko\")\n\nI should respond in Polish, briefly, and be helpful.",
